('2014:figurine-of-wondrous-power-silver-raven', '2014', 'Silver Raven Figurine of Wondrous Power', 'magic', 'Wondrous Items', 'Uncommon', false, null, null, null, 'Wondrous item, uncommon', 'A figurine of wondrous power is a statuette of a beast small enough to fit in a pocket. If you use an action to speak the command word and throw the figurine to a point on the ground within 60 feet of you, the figurine becomes a living creature. If the space where the creature would appear is occupied by other creatures or objects, or if there isn''t enough space for the creature, the figurine doesn''t become a creature.
